  "card": "Escapes backslashes in the Tor control AUTHENTICATE command when using HASHEDPASSWORD authentication. Currently, bitcoind only escapes quotation marks, which causes Tor to interpret backslashes in -torpassword as escape sequences, breaking authentication or malforming the command if the password contains backslashes. The author verified against Tor 0.4.9.12 that passwords containing backslashes fail authentication on master and succeed with this patch.",
